{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fantastical world reminiscent of Gion, with its rows of Japanese-style streets, in this exploration horror game reminiscent of the \u201cExit 8\u201d series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players uncover lurking \u201canomalies\u201d while drawing closer to the truth hidden behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you discern all the abnormalities lurking within this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV\uff1achunchunkoyagi</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days that should remain unchanged. Then why am I here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fox causing the anomalies, and the supernatural beings who abhor change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in this world with no allies, the chosen one\u2014me\u2014must pursue the mystery through prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress centers on discovering anomalies and praying with offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirming discovered anomalies advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making offerings unlocks new anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 30+ types of anomalies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We especially hope those who feel a certain dullness in their daily lives will play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Videos &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are highly encouraged! We'd be thrilled if you shared your impressions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Request from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent production by an amateur high school student. There may be areas of inexperience or bugs, but we'd be grateful if you could enjoy it with a kind eye.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Day the Gate Vanished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/eefdc8a9870a4cd0fd95877c50337e00fd9cdd6e.jpg"},{"name":"Realm of the Profound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/310ab0dc9da20bec776efe9e19c242d8a7360e26.jpg"},{"name":"What's Inside the Capsule?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/4971ceaf7b4b8c0d7974a1098a4870833acdaa78.jpg"},{"name":"Heaven and Earth Reversed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/f04c19300e439b7203142acb0dd4ef9a3caa3ba9.jpg"},{"name":"Invisible Streets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/e2e4db69131a07561a635a72d65fb82bb888ef16.jpg"},{"name":"Watch Out for Traffic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/11baef8693e380c49ce32dd1fe1b14072d672556.jpg"},{"name":"Mind Your Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/c95a11ffb24a4d67a314159b1e74a8efd3d57a09.jpg"},{"name":"Empty Road","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/e3d22e8f61baa4faedcb4649cdb0c073448f70c4.jpg"},{"name":"No Way Forward, No Way Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3997180/4cf6f4b6658d63ea5f5af9a2d2384