raph\" >Days that should remain unchanged. Then why am I here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fox causing the anomalies, and the supernatural beings who abhor change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in this world with no allies, the chosen one\u2014me\u2014must pursue the mystery through prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress centers on discovering anomalies and praying with offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirming discovered anomalies advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making offerings unlocks new anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 30+ types of anomalies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We especially hope those who feel a certain dullness in their daily lives will play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Videos &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are highly encouraged! We'd be thrilled if you shared your impressions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Request from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent production by an amateur high school student. There may be areas of inexperience or bugs, but we'd be grateful if you could enjoy it with a kind eye.</p>","developers":["Burg Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app